GoldSrcRenderCore contains no third-party source code and depends on the C++17
standard library only. Comments that name GoldSrc engine functions describe the
file-format behavior this library reproduces; no engine code is included.

The build fetches the formatting tooling MetaHookSv/FormatValidation (MIT) only
when it is configured with FORMAT_VALIDATION_ONLY=ON.

